WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:13.700
In a project, go down to Recurring

2
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.200
Tap Add Recurring

3
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:23.400
Name what repeats

4
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.900
Every week is already set — pick the day

5
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.400
The schedule reads back in words

6
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.000
Add

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.500
It sits under Recurring and comes back every Friday

8
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.100
To stop it for a while, open it…

9
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.700
…tap ⋯…

10
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:46.300
…and Pause recurrence

11
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:55.900
Paused — until you resume it
